        "affiliation": "Robert Bosch GmbH, Television Systems Division D-6100 Darmstadt, West Germany",
        "bio": "Roland Mester was born in 1958 in Offenbach/West Germany. He received the “Diplom-Engineer” degree in data engineering from the “Technische Hochschule Darmstadt” in 1984. The same year he joined Robert Bosch GmbH. TV-Studio Equipment Division. Darmstadt. He was involved in the DTTR development with special regard to error protection and shuffling schemes.",
